{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7277826565678661", "organization": {"id": "808571081129421", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "24442873231975103"}]}, "id": "1092643876318730"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "7277826565678661"}]}, "id": "990876286015382"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "7277826565678661", "release_date": 1742306400, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26539326982435331"}, "id": "3342367702733040"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1779889507, "id": "26595949366773092", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v23", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 8, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "26596196876748341"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "7277826565678661"}, "id": "26596196876748341", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7277826565678661", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "985660979216618"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2187721818732502", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Visual Scale", "keywords": ["PDF", "Planos", "Arquitecture", "Medidas", "Escala"], "long_description": "\u00a1Lleva la arquitectura de tu mente a una realidad tangible!\n\nCon nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n para Meta Quest, podr\u00e1s visualizar planos arquitect\u00f3nicos a escala real antes de construir. La distancia entre el papel y el espacio desaparece: camina por pasillos, entra en habitaciones y comprende vol\u00famenes, proporciones y distribuci\u00f3n como si el proyecto ya existiera.\n\nDise\u00f1ada para arquitectos, promotores, interioristas y propietarios, la herramienta proyecta planos en realidad mixta sobre tu entorno f\u00edsico a escala 1:1, con un 99% de precisi\u00f3n. Revisa medidas, detecta problemas, valida espacios y presenta tus ideas de forma clara, inmersiva y profesional.\n\nLa versi\u00f3n Pro incorpora Dise\u00f1o IA, una funci\u00f3n inteligente que analiza el plano en tiempo real, identifica errores, propone mejoras de distribuci\u00f3n y ofrece recomendaciones basadas en criterios actuales de dise\u00f1o. Es como contar con un consultor experto durante la visualizaci\u00f3n.\n\nCaracter\u00edsticas principales:\n\nVisualizaci\u00f3n MR inmersiva para explorar proyectos a tama\u00f1o real.\nAsistente de IA Pro con an\u00e1lisis, sugerencias y detecci\u00f3n de errores.\nHerramientas de precisi\u00f3n para medir dimensiones y ajustar colores.\nGesti\u00f3n de hasta 20 planos en PDF.\nCompatibilidad con formatos A1, A2, A3, A4 y ARCH A-D.\n\nLa aplicaci\u00f3n se calibra con la altura de Meta Guardian y es ideal para presentaciones a clientes, revisi\u00f3n de obra, validaci\u00f3n de espacios y dise\u00f1o de interiores.\n\nConvierte tus planos en experiencias inmersivas y vive tu proyecto antes de construirlo.", "short_description": "Experimenta la arquitectura como nunca antes con nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n de visualizaci\u00f3n a escala real para Oculus. \n\nTransforma tus planos 2D en realismo 1D (Escala 1:1) con el poder de la Realidad Mixta y ahora, \u00a1con el primer Asistente de Dise\u00f1o con IA integrado!. \n\nSum\u00e9rgete en cada detalle y experimenta la magnitud de cada dise\u00f1o con una nueva perspectiva inmersiva. \n\n\u00a1Descubre la arquitectura desde una nueva dimensi\u00f3n!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "VS_512.png", "id": "3751001895165341", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035419_3751001898498674_1688555981513549081_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YnLbit-6DHcQ7kNvwHa4kN_&_nc_oc=Adrspq3SIVGaJcvGJ00mcj1tcd9nbDuqyayr6dX54MTJuSAPmtqTPAMC-cKXkIFtAzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6StVDMSUuiVvww56yJUEmYt7Wd2VklFZQz8YuBjUicLA&oe=6A1EF673"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_2560x1440.png", "id": "1889730468511225", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1889730475177891_999439070283813274_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lV5oBYBn2EsQ7kNvwFVAhQ4&_nc_oc=Adr3IDeY2vVz4rUb4KcqkfLXWL4vB6T5oMuVGgaA3x58p6uE5FDm81Y66KLH7tO6lrU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6He_T_FhVnJ8uEMgz9-H_KkO-t3inNEDsLiqcnqJRAPg&oe=6A1EF27F"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_transparentLogo.png", "id": "1588463742556725", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393328_1588463745890058_102403380429675301_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QLHHf6xTp-EQ7kNvwFvBr49&_nc_oc=Adoz4suPVJ7jfyneesWM1X_NXCwQoG1ACGM3nRglfVGNhM8i1IygIaU7XEcSwuvLx0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6d4m9YfjqEdm913t3Eht5USPhaQlYAokR8n-8i4pDONQ&oe=6A1EF856"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_1008x1440.png", "id": "1371348467501966", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392019_1371348470835299_1238917553422211012_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RbFChn0FBAkQ7kNvwGz5heZ&_nc_oc=Adp-c8oSsBj2SduGXLGFGLGsYedAiKlCXWLsCrLbu8eqeaCrYO0e-m1hGa5sl7JBW3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5arzIJYVDaLfEhKHSE6ef0cvAu4Ll2quwmeCN71DGlSg&oe=6A1EF710"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_square_1440x1440.png", "id": "1358286308532659", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393826_1358286315199325_2468522928034152386_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3HA-OFdJAr4Q7kNvwFUdci_&_nc_oc=AdrFIN04CmskBS6kUMCNymbS1ZHeEUbUxTskeaFGrvd0irceZbThqODWWA9qaEGH4PM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af73udjY5olYz_hd-lnx-59_FDHlT8Sg2NBPXsir7FUTeA&oe=6A1EF0E7"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_hero_3000x900.png", "id": "1218783843186322", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_1218783846519655_8792533882279130158_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5nY240BEuzgQ7kNvwFmTJ2Z&_nc_oc=Adph5X-hVdCo2yNbq3uTwIk34TG_jGitJHFD3r8ooXMk-jIB8gxmDYdJViMSzBvwvYM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5QFE9D2FxgiH-9FeanUErUVAOLwgS2kYxhpf3I-hZ_Lg&oe=6A1EEF0E"}]}, "id": "899501353163503", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "VS_02.png", "id": "964205581746457", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391924_964205585079790_6039130210621333486_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3hcrOIomS30Q7kNvwFCTUCH&_nc_oc=AdpUQsdchxbRj_nHPOODESYzSYnkZovh6zeIodg9yfFwGmcn60z9mlXkh7C15Mo6xqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5bRVEob8qmvP_bvxJVlGRiCQzCUP0Qk_EDfaeMbpy0aA&oe=6A1EC8D1"}, {"file_name": "VS_01.png", "id": "1295369061506035", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391986_1295369064839368_3103918007861044277_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4uGXArfo6LMQ7kNvwHnMHcC&_nc_oc=Adq5V2u8h2FBa_TnYV-UmYRTBfCV7kp_Y6dBhtpbLdDeA3k12fTgiY8Bbti2mW2UDDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7PQtRLF0rYdlztTmSUq7Krzs9RwWg6qkwF0-qEdJPM7w&oe=6A1ED2C0"}, {"file_name": "VS_05.png", "id": "1117693143691729", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393320_1117693147025062_3419629515861726521_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gOOEUtQ3iBoQ7kNvwFNP1BF&_nc_oc=AdpZSTLHa2mQF74HK7gHXA5rVJkpvzXUYVVVAjlsgEyYDzeRmjaRD6dqNuE1Z069rOo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6g1wA3ZOY_wPmTIJsPqMGRrtjwqC4rY-H3WubkaO-pkw&oe=6A1EEE7A"}, {"file_name": "VS_03.png", "id": "1631517260781474", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1631517264114807_5303793590382583890_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pxb-wbKuD3IQ7kNvwFiobMD&_nc_oc=Adq_iV-xvJUHEeK1YGKDO8yG1w8RXndhzncuIrGmfpfRwFQFwN3yi6mjODpXKMPjbNM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LRWQQxm2-lvvlsFVG8Bi5lUEYO1Spd0V0oULETpvdEA&oe=6A1EDB2D"}, {"file_name": "VS_04.png", "id": "622674296902585", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392000_622674300235918_3940699530990601397_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oZmt4RSQPfcQ7kNvwGez71V&_nc_oc=AdqXyZrbsZijwVjfZ-qcoC7idb1_RoqXffrXoc_gBGzmGLgyXlBWa6Ob3H9gAxxPbVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7actMb4rGOoyrZJ8vjX9Wv3x2ybFtNZPLiHTAaH_d5iw&oe=6A1EDAD3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VS_04.png", "id": "1140633327978274", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393325_1140633331311607_4755148940050128248_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QCwmtITK-BcQ7kNvwFS3zkD&_nc_oc=AdpSOeLa_jtW4zWMOi5dYI2iCFa2jWEmI_0xLS6AN-mXGguBNM3fGmd5_3gZ1ZNTy4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4TLmJJ1-NYEorJwsC5IR-vGmxzacYZk1u5cPsVQGaFKw&oe=6A1EDDD4"}, "display_name": "Visual Scale", "keywords": ["pdf", "measures", "architecture", "FloorPlan", "Blueprint"], "long_description": "Experience Architecture Like Never Before!\n\nStep inside your blueprints and explore your future space at 1:1 scale. Our Meta Quest app bridges the gap between drawings and physical reality, letting you walk through projects before they are built.\n\nCreated for architects, designers and homeowners, the app offers an immersive and precise way to understand architecture. Feel the proportions, check each layout, review rooms and experience details as if you were inside the space.\n\nNew Feature: Intelligent AI Design Assistant (Pro Exclusive)\n\nDesign smarter with integrated AI. The assistant analyzes your floor plan in real time to detect errors, identify layout issues and provide actionable design suggestions. From space optimization to warnings, it works as an expert guide that helps you make better decisions during visualization.\n\nKey Features:\n\nFull-Scale MR Visualization: Walk through your blueprints in your real environment.\nAI Smart Suggestions (Pro): Real-time analysis, design advice and intelligent error detection.\nPrecision Tools: 99% measurement accuracy with instant color and texture adjustments.\nCloud Storage: Save and manage up to 20 PDF projects.\nFormat Flexibility: Supports A1, A2, A3, A4, ARCH A, ARCH B, ARCH C and ARCH D.\n\nTechnical Specifications:\n\nMeasurement Accuracy: 99%.\nFloor Height: Synced with your Meta Quest Guardian setup.\nBest Results: Use well-lit spaces for optimal anchoring and tracking.\n\nTurn blueprints into tangible experiences. Bring your architectural vision to life now!", "short_description": "Experience architecture like never before with our real-scale visualization app for Oculus.\n\nTransform your 2D plans into 1:1 realism with the power of Mixed Reality and now, with the first integrated AI Design Assistant!\n\nImmerse yourself in every detail and experience the true scale of each design from a new immersive perspective.\n\nDiscover architecture from a whole new dimension!"}]}, "developer_name": "Made in Verse", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.visualscale.xyz/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Made in Verse", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.visualscale.xyz/landing/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26596196876748341"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393826_1358286315199325_2468522928034152386_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3HA-OFdJAr4Q7kNvwFUdci_&_nc_oc=AdrFIN04CmskBS6kUMCNymbS1ZHeEUbUxTskeaFGrvd0irceZbThqODWWA9qaEGH4PM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5FsFrn322HTmdZPJmfvpDvH-5mE6KeJv3_dYcqaBYRPQ&oe=6A1EF0E7"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Visual Scale", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Utilities", "id": "393222478507326"}], "release_date": 1742306400, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "7277826579011993", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "7277826565678661", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "985660979216618"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1301786274236606", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Visual Scale", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Sum\u00e9rgete en el fascinante mundo de la arquitectura con nuestra innovadora aplicaci\u00f3n de visualizaci\u00f3n a escala real para Oculus. Esta aplicaci\u00f3n revolucionaria ofrece una experiencia \u00fanica al convertir planos arquitect\u00f3nicos a escala en tama\u00f1o real. Ahora, puedes explorar cada espacio con una precisi\u00f3n sin igual, permiti\u00e9ndote comprender mejor la distribuci\u00f3n, proporciones y detalles de cada dise\u00f1o.\n\nCon nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n, cada plano se transforma en una experiencia inmersiva donde puedes caminar libremente por los espacios, experimentando la sensaci\u00f3n de estar dentro de los propios planos. Desde amplias salas hasta rincones acogedores, cada detalle cobra vida de una manera sorprendente.\n\nAdem\u00e1s, nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n ofrece herramientas interactivas que te permiten realizar mediciones precisas, cambiar el color de los planos y personalizar tus experiencias seg\u00fan tus necesidades. Ya seas un profesional de la arquitectura en busca de una herramienta de visualizaci\u00f3n avanzada o simplemente un entusiasta del dise\u00f1o interesado en explorar nuevas ideas, nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n para Oculus te ofrece una manera emocionante y educativa de interactuar con la arquitectura.\n\nSum\u00e9rgete en un mundo donde los planos dejan de ser simples representaciones para convertirse en experiencias tangibles y envolventes. Descubre la arquitectura desde una nueva dimensi\u00f3n y desata tu creatividad con nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n de visualizaci\u00f3n a escala real para Oculus.", "short_description": " Experimenta la arquitectura como nunca antes con nuestra aplicaci\u00f3n de visualizaci\u00f3n a escala real para Oculus. Convierte planos a escala en tama\u00f1o real para explorar y comprender los espacios con dimensiones precisas. Sum\u00e9rgete en cada detalle y experimenta la magnitud de cada dise\u00f1o con una nueva perspectiva inmersiva. \u00a1Descubre la arquitectura desde una nueva dimensi\u00f3n!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "VS_512.png", "id": "3751001895165341", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035419_3751001898498674_1688555981513549081_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YnLbit-6DHcQ7kNvwHa4kN_&_nc_oc=Adrspq3SIVGaJcvGJ00mcj1tcd9nbDuqyayr6dX54MTJuSAPmtqTPAMC-cKXkIFtAzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6StVDMSUuiVvww56yJUEmYt7Wd2VklFZQz8YuBjUicLA&oe=6A1EF673"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_transparentLogo.png", "id": "1319766789439450", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75196225_1319766792772783_7928652365932608875_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=szwQd0VL4hcQ7kNvwGZDmCS&_nc_oc=Ado1MtMfFi-dypKts9EJQsXxm4hcmyDDL_qNoYUG4UJjIEvKVsjlrmPiYOYfazAVPk0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4oaOL7jlsgvOZ0CdZhMNhH2MlWvnA1AElGI7qt4sNXcw&oe=6A1EEB55"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_1008x1440.png", "id": "1314183166270131", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974741_1314183169603464_8081139173784810793_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z8_WUIFIgNYQ7kNvwF9JJWp&_nc_oc=AdrPYz8F1AebseRTPOCjsUu5VjXyT27Ok6gtBCKAfQA-TvZ_zCugOoFjxbyZrNn4Rgo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Lbp_79t95FCEKBG5r_DcAzdUshrcQEKH5EnLW07qS_A&oe=6A1EF73A"}, {"file_name": "AppLabImage_hero_3000x900.png", "id": "1067690668492983", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_1067690671826316_3686965055072015159_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lmW3jaKO31MQ7kNvwEOJLJi&_nc_oc=AdqoPGJ0eUN_DMGS200WlGxmtezvwSya1h1nu8Q1kxnd3p8VhfdPx2hmqnd